function esportsDialogControls(overlay){const previous=document.activeElement;const key=['valorant','lol','dota'].find(k=>previous?.dataset?.[k]!=null),value=key?previous.dataset[key]:null;const onKey=e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();close();}};const close=()=>{document.removeEventListener('keydown',onKey,true);overlay.remove();const target=previous?.isConnected?previous:(key?document.querySelector('[data-'+key+'="'+CSS.escape(value)+'"]'):null);target?.focus({preventScroll:true});};document.addEventListener('keydown',onKey,true);overlay.querySelector('[data-close]').onclick=close;overlay.onclick=e=>{if(e.target===overlay)close();};overlay.querySelector('[data-close]').focus({preventScroll:true});return close;}
